# Signing material — must NEVER be committed.
#
# The Android upload-key keystore (privycs-upload.keystore) and the
# Play Store-downloaded App-Signing certificate (deployment_cert.der)
# both live in .privycs-keys/. Anything in that directory is local-
# only; CI gets the keystore via base64-encoded GitHub Secret
# (ANDROID_KEYSTORE_B64), not from this tree.
.privycs-keys/

# Defensive: catch any other key/cert material that might end up
# elsewhere in the tree by accident. *.pem covers exported public
# certs (still better not committed — they're identifiers); the
# rest are explicitly secret-bearing formats.
*.keystore
*.jks
*.der
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

# Specifically the Play Console "Download deployment_cert" file —
# regardless of where saved.
deployment_cert*
